#, no-c-format
msgid "Type a letter to guess the word"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file mainw.ui line 428
#: rc.cpp:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You type a letter that you think is in the word to guess. You can then either "
"press the Enter key on your keyboard or press the Guess button to see if the "
"letter will be present in the word."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file mainw.ui line 722
#: rc.cpp:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click on it to see if the letter you entered is in the word"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file mainw.ui line 726
#: rc.cpp:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you click on the Guess button, the letter you entered will either be in "
"the word or in the misses. In that case. the hangman will be drawn further. If "
"you already tried this letter, a passive popup will tell you so and you will "
"not lose a try.\n"
"The Guess button has the same function as to press the Enter key on your "
"keyboard."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file normal.ui line 32
#: rc.cpp:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Require more &guesses for duplicate letters"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file normal.ui line 35
#: rc.cpp:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this if you do not want to display each instance of the same letter"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file normal.ui line 41
#: rc.cpp:96
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you check this box, only the first letter will be written if the letter is "
"found in several places in the word. Then when you rechoose this letter, it "
"will replace the second instance in the word until there are no more instances "
"of this letter.\n"
"For example, the word to guess is \"potato\". If this option is unchecked, when "
"you try \"o\", the 2 \"o\" in the word will be discovered at the same time. If "
"this is checked, you will need to try \"o\" twice.\n"
"\n"
"Default is that for one letter typed, all instances of that letter in the word "
"are displayed."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file normal.ui line 49
#: rc.cpp:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not display the 'Congratulations! You &won!' dialog"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file normal.ui line 52
#: rc.cpp:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If checked, the dialog 'Congratulations! You won!' is not displayed. After 3 "
"seconds, a new game will start automatically."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file normal.ui line 58
#: rc.cpp:108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is not checked, when a game is won a dialog will appear saying "
"'Congratulations! You won!'.\n"
"This is the default state.\n"
"\n"
"If this option is checked, this dialog will not appear and a new game will "
"automatically start after three seconds."
msgstr ""

